{
  "protocol_name": "Serial 1:10 dilution of culture in 0.9% saline",
  "description": "Fills plate columns 1-8 with 90 uL sterile saline, adds 10 uL of culture to column 1, then serially transfers 10 uL from each column to the next after mixing, giving 10^-1 to 10^-8 in 8 replicate rows.",
  "assumptions": [
    "The protocol's 1 mL culture into 1 mL-scale saline is read as a 1:10 dilution (1 part culture + 9 parts saline), scaled 1/100 to 10 uL culture + 90 uL saline per well. The text's '10 ml of the solvent' would be 1:11; I followed the explicit 1:10 ratio.",
    "volume_ul is per channel. An 8-channel aspiration draws 8x that volume from a single container.",
    "The culture is not on the deck list. I assumed it is loaded in tube_15ml; the 5000 uL starting volume is an assumption (the protocol gives no volume).",
    "Column k holds dilution 10^-k: columns 1-8 cover 10^-1 to 10^-8, which spans the 10-100 CFU/mL target for typical counts. The scientist selects the column to plate.",
    "Each column is mixed (50 uL aspirate/dispense) with fresh tips before the 10 uL transfer, so tips never draw from a well they just filled.",
    "Each transfer leaves 90 uL in the source column; column 8 keeps its 100 uL after mixing, with no further transfer.",
    "Tip columns 1-10 of hamilton_tiprack_96 are used once each; hamilton_tiprack_96_b is not used.",
    "Sterile technique and sterile tips are assumed. The protocol says the saline was sterilized but does not specify tip sterility.",
    "Reservoir loaded with 8000 uL: the saline fill needs 8 columns x 90 uL x 8 channels = 5760 uL, plus dead volume.",
    "Not done by the robot, and must be done outside the deck: plating the chosen dilutions onto agar, incubating ('optimum growth'), and counting colonies to confirm the 10-100 CFU/mL target."
  ],
  "reagents": {
    "reservoir_50ml": "0.9% normal saline solution (sterilized)",
    "tube_15ml": "Overnight/optimum-growth bacterial culture (volume assumed)"
  },
  "initial_volumes_ul": {
    "reservoir_50ml": 8000,
    "tube_15ml": 5000
  },
